WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.634
An organization hierarchy is a classic recursive
example We

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:11.180
start with the root employee whose manager ID is
NULL Then we find

00:00:11.193 --> 00:00:17.504
employees who report to that root Then employees who
report to those employees

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:22.685
Depth tells us the level and a path string lets us
see the route from

00:00:22.711 --> 00:00:24.040
the top of the hierarchy
